<title>GERMANY: Volksfuersorge says H1 business good.</title>
<headline>Volksfuersorge says H1 business good.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Volksfuersorge AG said on Tuesday that its first half life and non-life new business remained good and that it would pay at least an unchanged dividend of 15 marks per share on 1997 results.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
